Package: powerup
Title: Power Up Your PowerPoint Presentations
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: c(
      person("Ellis", "Hughes", email = "ellis.h.hughes@gsk.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0637-4436")), 
      person("Shannon", "Haughton", email = "shannon.l.haughton@gsk.com", role = "aut"),
      person("Romain", "François", email = "romain@tada.science", role = "aut"), 
      person("GlaxoSmithKline Research & Development Limited", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
    )
Description: Programmatically interact with new or existing 'Microsoft PowerPoint' documents,
    by adding new slides, updating existing slides, and inserting displays into specific locations in slides.
    Users can also add transition effects to slides, and add displays to specific
    locations in slides by pointing to specific placeholders or creating new ones.
    Preview the slides in a local viewer.
